          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            For most walls in most homes, a quality 100% acrylic paint rolled in two coats over a well-prepared surface is all you need, and KILZ Tribute is the best of those you can order online. Use Magnolia Home when a pre-mixed designer colour is the point, Zinsser Perma-White in any room that steams up, and KILZ Complete Coat for mudrooms, garages and other hard-working spaces.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Spend paint-store money where it shows: deep colours, cleanable matte finishes and the one or two rooms that take the most abuse. And remember that sheen choice, primer on patches and a good brush and roller will change the result more than any upgrade to the can.
